nshot4.png", "id": "766482238796501", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210401_766482242129834_7777293721774243715_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ot3_V9xuSK8Q7kNvwFUYiYC&_nc_oc=AdrmMGOEp5kM4bp5JlUfiWUmXZuEDJoIg_OhypLOR9BV48Ql-O-4hTX-zLQD3mvUs1A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUhSURSD_NZY8q9m4fbhBhXui7CJ-g04zhks_-9iy5DjQ&oe=6B0EF7BF"}, {"file_name": "motor grader - screenshot5.png", "id": "462114316249595", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974660_462114319582928_4452116861395859515_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XQGCewCFg1wQ7kNvwGY1qC_&_nc_oc=Adrifx8GDtCF6lQRYvheyyLAIfV9IMnWJ44u42ctR-IgdRP89hMcluOHq3bht1tnRqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUXgH52jYQEpccKs7e87HzEUBgozpZ4_GN_ge-kCJccWg&oe=6B0F17E3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "motor grader - trailer cover.png", "id": "840143774838027", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86597262_840143778171360_6047656471363500610_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BDnbVCAh_Z0Q7kNvwHmqTAJ&_nc_oc=AdqwC2B2R81I2_7UBrzKRN7zdTCS9z_H07wXM48EY7Kvc_GnKIakdeqXZMnY0QuJpTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWL0LuMTda_dqay3BjfrYSz1_ajT9lEcq2HE4M4fNJS9w&oe=6B0F0F90"}, "display_name": "Motor Grader Safety and Operation", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Motor graders are versatile machines that play a pivotal role in various projects. Participants will operate a bulldozer and complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of this engaging simulation. \n\n**Overview & Activities:**\n\nParticipants begin with an overview that provides context and helps identify key parts and components outside and inside the vehicle, safety tips, and the basics of a walk-around inspection performed before using any heavy machinery. Participants engage in a sort-and-match activity to reinforce essential controls and their location inside the vehicle. They are then asked to perform a single task to become familiar with operating the vehicle in a VR environment. \n\n**Participant Simulation:**\n\nBefore starting their simulation tasks, participants must wear personal protective equipment (PPE), conduct a walk-around inspection of the vehicle, and complete one task to familiarize themselves with the vehicle's operation. Finally, participants are challenged to complete tasks at an active worksite, including leveling a small hill, moving piles of dirt into targeted areas, and filling a trench with rocks and stones. \n\n**Benefits & Key Features:**\n- Manipulative simulations provide hands-on practice in risk-free environments  \n- Instant feedback provides \u201ccorrect\" or \"try again\" responses to guide participants  \n- Flexible choice points allow participants to revisit any part of the simulation as needed \n- Realistic 3D tools, equipment, environments, and animations  ", "short_description": "Motor graders are versatile machines that play a pivotal role in various projects. Participants will operate a bulldozer and complete various tasks on an active worksite as part of this engaging simulation. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Holo Pundits", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.holopundits.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "reco